{
    "title": "TrillerTV: Live Sports",
    "description": "TrillerTV streams premium live sport and entertainment to millions of fans around the world. Includes Boxing, Pro Wrestling, MMA, Soccer, and many more! Watch live and on-demand on any screen.\r\n\r\nWatch premium live sport and entertainment from AEW, BKFC, Showtime Boxing, TopRank/ESPN, PBC/Fox, NJPW, Impact Wrestling, Rizin, Glory Kickboxing, One Championship, FIFA, and many more.\r\n\r\nTrillerTV+ subscription, the best value in streaming sports:\r\nGet the best value in streaming sports with a TrillerTV+ subscription, offering a regular slate of live programming and on-demand access to Pro Wrestling, Bare Knuckle, MMA, Soccer and other sports events. \r\n\r\nTrillerTV+ brings you Live & Exclusive football every week! Eredivisie 2024/25, Liga Portugal Betclic 2024/25, AFC Champions League Elite\u2122 2024/25, AFC Champions League Two\u2122 2024/25,  AFC Asian Cup Qatar\u2122 2023, and more stream Live for our football fans in the UK and Ireland. \r\n\r\nThe international home of AEW Plus:\r\nGet exclusive access to AEW weekly programming, including live and on-demand access to Dynamite, Rampage, and Collision, as well as other special programming, available to watch with no commercial breaks on all your devices. \r\nEnjoy members-only discounts on AEW pay-per-views and special PPV bundle offers. \r\n\r\nDownload the app and sign up for free:\r\n\u2022 1,000+ live events per year\r\n\u2022 10,000+ hours of on-demand programming\r\n\u2022 Superior HD viewing experience \r\n\u2022 Multi-platform watch wherever\r\n\u2022 Includes DVR, live chat, and free replays\r\n\u2022 Multi-language on applicable events\r\n\u2022 7-day free access to TrillerTV+ and AEW Plus\r\n\u2022 The international home of AEW Plus\r\n\r\nTop Brands:\r\n\u2022 Boxing: Triller Fight Club, Top Rank/ESPN, PBC/Fox, Boxxer, Golden Boy, Matchroom, BKB, BKFC, Don King \r\n\u2022 Pro Wrestling: All Elite Wrestling, WWE, IMPACT, NJPW, NWA\r\n\u2022 MMA: RIZIN, Hex, Shamrock FC, Fusion Fight League, Subversiv, Fight2Win, Invicta\r\n\u2022 Soccer: FIFA South American World Cup Qualifiers\r\n\u2022 Motorsports: Moto FITE Klub\r\n\u2022 Entertainment - VERZUZ\r\n\u2022 Basketball: BIG3\r\n\u2022 Plus 100s of other promotions\r\n\r\nCheck out our live schedule and start watching:\r\nhttps://www.trillertv.com/schedule/\r\n\r\nHow to watch:\r\nIt\u2019s your call - TrillerTV is available on your phone, tablet, desktop, Smart TV (Samsung, LG, Hisense, Sony, Panasonic, Vizio, Philips and more) or to your streaming devices including Amazon Fire TV, Roku, Chromecast and others. Alternatively you can cast directly from your mobile to a compatible connected TV. Sign in to TrillerTV and kick start your viewing experience on any device or continue watching on any other platform using one account only.\r\n\r\nGet the TrillerTV app now and join a community of 8M+ sports fans from around the world!\r\n\r\nPayment will be charged to your Google Play Account on confirmation of purchase. Subscription automatically renews for your selected subscription tier unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period.\r\n\r\nYour subscription begins with a purchase. If you decide to upgrade or downgrade your subscription level, any unused portion of the current subscription will be forfeited.You may disable auto-renewals or cancel an active subscription anytime through your Google Play Account Account settings.\r\n\r\nStill have questions? Head over to https://support.trillertv.com/\r\n\r\nTrillerTV is owned by Triller Hold Co.\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://www.trillertv.com/p/terms-of-service/\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.trillertv.com/p/privacy-policy/",
    "descriptionHTML": "TrillerTV streams premium live sport and entertainment to millions of fans around the world. Includes Boxing, Pro Wrestling, MMA, Soccer, and many more! Watch live and on-demand on any screen.<br><br>Watch premium live sport and entertainment from AEW, BKFC, Showtime Boxing, TopRank/ESPN, PBC/Fox, NJPW, Impact Wrestling, Rizin, Glory Kickboxing, One Championship, FIFA, and many more.<br><br>TrillerTV+ subscription, the best value in streaming sports:<br>Get the best value in streaming sports with a TrillerTV+ subscription, offering a regular slate of live programming and on-demand access to Pro Wrestling, Bare Knuckle, MMA, Soccer and other sports events. <br><br>TrillerTV+ brings you Live &amp; Exclusive football every week! Eredivisie 2024/25, Liga Portugal Betclic 2024/25, AFC Champions League Elite\u2122 2024/25, AFC Champions League Two\u2122 2024/25,  AFC Asian Cup Qatar\u2122 2023, and more stream Live for our football fans in the UK and Ireland. <br><br>The international home of AEW Plus:<br>Get exclusive access to AEW weekly programming, including live and on-demand access to Dynamite, Rampage, and Collision, as well as other special programming, available to watch with no commercial breaks on all your devices. <br>Enjoy members-only discounts on AEW pay-per-views and special PPV bundle offers. <br><br>Download the app and sign up for free:<br>\u2022 1,000+ live events per year<br>\u2022 10,000+ hours of on-demand programming<br>\u2022 Superior HD viewing experience <br>\u2022 Multi-platform watch wherever<br>\u2022 Includes DVR, live chat, and free replays<br>\u2022 Multi-language on applicable events<br>\u2022 7-day free access to TrillerTV+ and AEW Plus<br>\u2022 The international home of AEW Plus<br><br>Top Brands:<br>\u2022 Boxing: Triller Fight Club, Top Rank/ESPN, PBC/Fox, Boxxer, Golden Boy, Matchroom, BKB, BKFC, Don King <br>\u2022 Pro Wrestling: All Elite Wrestling, WWE, IMPACT, NJPW, NWA<br>\u2022 MMA: RIZIN, Hex, Shamrock FC, Fusion Fight League, Subversiv, Fight2Win, Invicta<br>\u2022 Soccer: FIFA South American World Cup Qualifiers<br>\u2022 Motorsports: Moto FITE Klub<br>\u2022 Entertainment - VERZUZ<br>\u2022 Basketball: BIG3<br>\u2022 Plus 100s of other promotions<br><br>Check out our live schedule and start watching:<br>https://www.trillertv.com/schedule/<br><br>How to watch:<br>It\u2019s your call - TrillerTV is available on your phone, tablet, desktop, Smart TV (Samsung, LG, Hisense, Sony, Panasonic, Vizio, Philips and more) or to your streaming devices including Amazon Fire TV, Roku, Chromecast and others. Alternatively you can cast directly from your mobile to a compatible connected TV. Sign in to TrillerTV and kick start your viewing experience on any device or continue watching on any other platform using one account only.<br><br>Get the TrillerTV app now and join a community of 8M+ sports fans from around the world!<br><br>Payment will be charged to your Google Play Account on confirmation of purchase. Subscription automatically renews for your selected subscription tier unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period.<br><br>Your subscription begins with a purchase. If you decide to upgrade or downgrade your subscription level, any unused portion of the current subscription will be forfeited.You may disable auto-renewals or cancel an active subscription anytime through your Google Play Account Account settings.<br><br>Still have questions? Head over to https://support.trillertv.com/<br><br>TrillerTV is owned by Triller Hold Co.<br><br>Terms of Service: https://www.trillertv.com/p/terms-of-service/<br>Privacy Policy: https://www.trillertv.com/p/privacy-policy/",
